<item><title>Senegal federation challenges Morocco’s awarded Africa Cup title at sports court</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/senegal-federation-challenges-morocco-s-awarded-africa-cup-01f90b/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/senegal-federation-challenges-morocco-s-awarded-africa-cup-01f90b/</guid><category>Senegal</category><description>The African football confederation gave Morocco a 3-0 forfeit win after Senegal had beaten it 1-0 in the 18 January final.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 11:35:27 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sn.jpg" length="32606" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Senegal PM proposes statistics fund as harvest data gaps hinder sales</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/senegal-pm-proposes-statistics-fund-as-harvest-data-gaps-9d9702/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/senegal-pm-proposes-statistics-fund-as-harvest-data-gaps-9d9702/</guid><category>Senegal</category><description>Ahmadou Al Aminou Lô says missing production totals leave crop sellers without reliable market guides and make banks struggle to assess farmers’ needs.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 08:07:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sn.jpg" length="32606" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Police send woman to Dakar prosecutor over alleged extortion</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/police-send-woman-to-dakar-prosecutor-over-alleged-extortion-1f7414/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/police-send-woman-to-dakar-prosecutor-over-alleged-extortion-1f7414/</guid><category>Senegal</category><description>A Grand-Dakar shopkeeper said she threatened to accuse him of attempted rape after he refused a second request for transport money.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 07:29:25 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sn.jpg" length="32606" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Senegal’s bakeries extend strike over state-set baguette price</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/senegal-s-bakeries-extend-strike-over-state-set-baguette-0108a4/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/senegal-s-bakeries-extend-strike-over-state-set-baguette-0108a4/</guid><category>Senegal</category><description>Three of four employer unions called for production to stop; 35% of bakeries were closed nationwide on Monday, according to the unions.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 03:34:23 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/senegal-s-bakeries-extend-strike-over-state-set-baguette-0108a4/share.jpg" length="41587" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/senegal-s-bakeries-extend-strike-over-state-set-baguette-0108a4/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Senegal awaits sports court ruling on stripped Afcon title</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/senegal-awaits-sports-court-ruling-on-stripped-afcon-title-671429/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/senegal-awaits-sports-court-ruling-on-stripped-afcon-title-671429/</guid><category>Senegal</category><description>The Court of Arbitration for Sport is deciding Senegal’s appeal against the decision awarding the 2025 championship to Morocco.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 11:56:41 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sn.jpg" length="32606" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
